102	  // durable one (Actions logs expire, the item does not), while this printed copy
103	  // lands in the session transcript, which is what the usage fold reads for the
104	  // task-status census. The fold dedupes on the record's own tuple within a
105	  // capture file, so a line appearing in stdout and in the harness's echo of it
106	  // counts once.
107	  const rec = recordLine(item, spec.record);
